      "failures": [],
      "outcome": "answered",
      "handoff_reason": null,
      "intent": "question",
      "reply": "Yes \u2014 cancelling three days ahead means you're giving 48 hours or more notice, which qualifies for a full refund of the amount you paid.",
      "tokens": 2298,
      "usd": 0.01413
    },
    {
      "id": "q02",
      "category": "question",
      "conversation_id": "e8045709-e191-4113-bb53-60aaccbdfd28",
      "passed": true,
      "failures": [],
      "outcome": "answered",
      "handoff_reason": null,
      "intent": "question",
      "reply": "Once a refund is approved, it goes back to your original payment method, and card refunds usually show up within 5 to 10 business days depending on your bank. If you paid with Apple Pay or Google Pay, it follows the timeline of the linked card. We aren't able to send refunds to a different card or to a bank account.",
      "tokens": 2309,
      "usd": 0.015225
    },
    {
      "id": "q03",
      "category": "question",
      "conversation_id": "9262c682-7d5a-4cef-a9a5-d3a6d8c63e8a",
      "passed": true,
      "failures": [],
      "outcome": "answered",
      "handoff_reason": null,
      "intent": "question",
      "reply": "Yes \u2014 changes made less than 24 hours before the appointment carry a $25 late change fee, since your professional has already planned their route. If you move it at least 24 hours ahead, rescheduling is free. Keep in mind you can reschedule a booking up to two times before you'd need to cancel and rebook.",
      "tokens": 2355,
      "usd": 0.015675
    },
    {
      "id": "q04",
      "category": "question",
      "conversation_id": "5343690b-7ca9-4f54-9085-2196bea5d2f7",
      "passed": true,
      "failures": [],
      "outcome": "answered",
      "handoff_reason": null,
      "intent": "question",
      "reply": "A deep cleaning is $240 for homes up to 1,500 square feet, so a small apartment would fall under that rate. It includes everything in a standard clean plus inside cabinets, baseboards, the oven, fridge interior, and window sills. Supplies and equipment are included, though you can ask us to use your own products in the booking notes.",
      "tokens": 2432,
      "usd": 0.0163
    },
    {
      "id": "q05",
      "category": "question",
      "conversation_id": "7da567de-bdb2-40f2-a594-29a5b45873ce",
      "passed": false,
      "failures": [
        "outcome=no_answer"
      ],
      "outcome": "no_answer",
      "handoff_reason": null,
      "intent": "question",
      "reply": "I couldn't find that in our help center. Would you like me to connect you with a person?",
      "tokens": 2175,
      "usd": 0.013255
    },
    {
      "id": "q06",
      "category": "question",
      "conversation_id": "8f856ff2-9781-4e3f-971f-a6a2628a9626",
      "passed": true,
      "failures": [],
      "outcome": "answered",
      "handoff_reason": null,
      "intent": "question",
      "reply": "Yes, we serve Denver, Colorado, covering addresses up to 25 miles from downtown. Just enter your ZIP code in the app to confirm your address is within our coverage before booking.",
      "tokens": 2151,
      "usd": 0.013475
    },
    {
      "id": "q07",
      "category": "question",
      "conversation_id": "1115f7aa-8bae-430e-b4ad-91be24e70550",
      "passed": true,
      "failures": [],
      "outcome": "answered",
      "handoff_reason": null,
      "intent": "question",
      "reply": "Yes \u2014 plumbers (and electricians) must hold a valid state license, and we verify it before they're activated. They also pass identity verification and a criminal background check before their first job, repeated annually, plus a skills assessment and safety training.",
      "tokens": 2094,
      "usd": 0.01359
    },
    {
      "id": "q08",
      "category": "question",
      "conversation_id": "d91b6657-1365-4b90-a6ba-f54b55c90240",
      "passed": true,
      "failures": [],
      "outcome": "answered",
      "handoff_reason": null,
      "intent": "question",
      "reply": "You can request account deletion in the app under Account Settings, then Privacy, and your account is deleted within 30 days. Just note that any upcoming bookings need to be cancelled first. Payment and invoice records are kept for seven years because tax law requires it.",
      "tokens": 2123,
      "usd": 0.013815
    },
    {
      "id": "q09",
      "category": "question",
